#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:453
msgid "microSD card"
msgstr "microSD 카드"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:455
msgid ""
"When a card is inserted it is mounted automatically at ``/sdcard`` and is "
